==Strategy==
A rather difficult stage without units with the [[Wave Shield|Wave Blocker]] ability, as you'd need to rely on RNG so that Dober doesn't produce too many waves that can destroy your units. The best way to approach this stage is to use only one meatshield, while stacking ranged area attackers capable of outranging dober and the SBKs. [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] can help massively here since she can help push Dober away from your units.

'''Do not send out meatshields when there are no SBKs on the field.'''

On 4 crown, the only thing that changes is the amount of ranged attackers you'll be able to use. However, every enemy here is on 2 crown magnifications, so the stage will be way more difficult than 1 crown. [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] is an amazing attacker/ranged meatshield for 4 crown, and with her good DPS, a good stack of her can deal a lot of damage to the Dober before dying. [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi]] is a good meatshield for this stage on 4 crown, since he doesn't have too much endurance and will survive at least 2 hits from the SBK waves.

